Package: fastkcv
Title: Fast Exact Cross-Validation for Global Kriging
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Nicholas", "Taylor", , "74337949+n-c-taylor@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast, exact leave-one-out and k-fold cross-validation for
    global (unique neighbourhood) simple, ordinary and universal kriging,
    computed from a single factorization of the covariance matrix.
    Designed as a companion to gstat::krige.cv(), reproducing its output
    to numerical precision.
